From: plastron
Subject: [PATCH] bootstage marks for timing U-Boot without serial

Marks after the init steps most likely to be slow, so the record U-Boot
leaves in the device tree (CONFIG_BOOTSTAGE_FDT) shows where its time
goes. The tree is shrunk to its minimum before that record is written,
which left room for only four entries, so the shrink keeps 4 KiB spare.
Development only.
---
--- a/common/board_f.c	2026-10-01 05:37:47.402304308 +0000
+++ b/common/board_f.c	2026-10-01 05:37:47.404682074 +0000
